<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>404 — Page Not Found — CyberSec</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=block" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        @font-face{font-family:'SG';src:local('Space Grotesk');font-display:block}
        @font-face{font-family:'JB';src:local('JetBrains Mono');font-display:block}
        *,*::before,*::after{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
        html,body{min-height:100%;background:#000}
        body{-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;text-rendering:geometricPrecision;color:#fff;font-family:'SG','Space Grotesk',sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:100vh}
        a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
        :root{--red:#c81b1c;--ink:#fff;--sub:#e6e6e6;--lab:#949494}

        .err-card{width:100%;max-width:480px;padding:40px 24px;text-align:center}
        .err-logo{display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:32px}
        .err-logo svg{width:54px;height:54px}
        .err-eyebrow{font-family:'JB','JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--red);margin-bottom:12px}
        .err-title{font-weight:700;font-size:52px;letter-spacing:-2px;margin-bottom:12px;line-height:1}
        .err-desc{font-family:'JB','JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:14px;color:var(--lab);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:32px}
        .err-btn{
            display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;
            background:var(--red);color:#fff;border:none;cursor:pointer;
            padding:14px 28px;
            font-family:'SG','Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.2px;
            transition:background .2s;
        }
        .err-btn:hover{background:#b01617}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="err-card">
    <a href="/" class="err-logo">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 46 46" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <g stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="butt"><line x1="23" y1="0" x2="23" y2="19.5"/><polyline points="14,10.2 23,19.2 32,10.2" fill="none"/></g>
            <g stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="butt" transform="rotate(90,23,23)"><line x1="23" y1="0" x2="23" y2="19.5"/><polyline points="14,10.2 23,19.2 32,10.2" fill="none"/></g>
            <g stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="butt" transform="rotate(180,23,23)"><line x1="23" y1="0" x2="23" y2="19.5"/><polyline points="14,10.2 23,19.2 32,10.2" fill="none"/></g>
            <g stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="butt" transform="rotate(270,23,23)"><line x1="23" y1="0" x2="23" y2="19.5"/><polyline points="14,10.2 23,19.2 32,10.2" fill="none"/></g>
        </svg>
    </a>
    <div class="err-eyebrow">Error 404 // Resource Missing</div>
    <h1 class="err-title">Sector Not Found</h1>
    <p class="err-desc">The requested endpoint or sector does not exist or has been re-indexed. Return to base perimeter.</p>
    <a href="/" class="err-btn">← Return to Safety</a>
</div>
</body>
</html>
